{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien plants convert sunlight into energy. Infuse broken components with that power to spark new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/787bbd6c9d35ecdb0ab019d03db8691c.poster.avif?t=1759477658\" width=380 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/787bbd6c9d35ecdb0ab019d03db8691c.webm?t=1759477658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scanner to find hidden tracks below the surface and draw energy along them to spread life to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/c523ea2b3514ea73042059144bd147ed.poster.avif?t=1759477658\" width=380 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/c523ea2b3514ea73042059144bd147ed.webm?t=1759477658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and plant seed pods and watch the interplay of nature and technology unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/2706ca19f11d24c5233eca02fb28b018.poster.avif?t=1759477658\" width=380 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/2706ca19f11d24c5233eca02fb28b018.webm?t=1759477658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This charming solar-punk adventure rewards thoughtful interaction with its vibrant world. The unfolding story is as unique as the way you play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1735350?t=1759477658","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/a8fbdfda0d205fae445a98be13721eec29d88a8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759477658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/4ed5647c0f3d0299b6edf08d75d45f6ec90c2ded/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759477658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/4ed5647c0f3d0299b6edf08d75d45f6ec90c2ded/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759477658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien plants convert sunlight into energy. Infuse broken components with that power to spark new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/787bbd6c9d35ecdb0ab019d03db8691c.poster.avif?t=1759477658\" width=380 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735350/extras/787bbd6c9d35ecdb0ab019d03db8691c.webm?t=1759477658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scanner to find hidden tracks below the surface and draw energy along them to spread life to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m